125,000 Comebacks=<p></p>
Thanks to everyone who's giving Battle Cats another go!<br>
You helped us reach 125,000 comebacks and unlocked a Rare Ticket for everyone!

On October 11th at the end of the 5th Year Celebration everyone will receive<br>
・1 Rare Ticket<br>
